From: Craterbrain <58347640+Craterbrain@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 11:14:44 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] PlaitOS: one Always-on display page with the schedule,
 charging and Peek Display

- Display > Always show time and info opens a PlaitOS page instead of the
  stock catalyst one: the switch, "When it shows" (Always, Only while
  charging, the schedules with their times, Also while charging) and Peek
  Display with breathing
- Lock screen > PlaitOS keeps a link to it instead of the scattered rows;
  the separate Peek Display page is gone

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017VXjYUWzBqMCeUoJD2Suc4
